<task id="115" project="customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>GitHub Actions workflow for sidecar build/push (ACR + Trivy gate) -- coordinated with ci-cd-r1</title>
    <phase>C'' Wave G-1 -- Foundation</phase>
    <gate>blocked</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>STANDARD</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>New workflow file authoring, no existing .cs/Bicep modification; STANDARD per root CLAUDE.md §8, but coordination-flagged because it touches .github/workflows/**.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Mechanical CI workflow authoring following the repo's existing Trivy-gated build patterns -- Sonnet @ high.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>waveG1-parallel</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
